LL (NASDAQ: HON) TODAY ANNOUNCED RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 THAT MET OR EXCEEDED THE COMPANY'S ORIGINAL GUIDANCE DESPITE A CHALLENGING OPERATING ENVIRONMENT."}{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:30:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED INCREASES ITS PRIME RATE TO 7.75 PERCENT', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, OHIO , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: HBAN) ANNOUNCED THAT ITS PRIME RATE IS INCREASING TO 7.75 PERCENT FROM 7.5 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE FEBRUARY 2, 2023. THE RATE WAS LAST CHANGED ON DECEMBER 15, 2022, WHEN HUNTINGTON INCREASED IT TO 7.5 PERCENT FROM 7 PERCENT.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-02 20:41:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: POMERANTZ LAW FIRM INVESTIGATES CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION - IBM', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 2, 2023) - POMERANTZ LLP IS INVESTIGATING CLAIMS ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM). SUCH INVESTORS ARE ADVISED TO CONTACT ROBERT S. WILLOUGHBY AT NEWACTION@POMLAW.COM OR 888-476-6529, EXT. 7980.THE INVESTIGATION CONCERNS WHETHER IBM AND CERTAIN OF ITS OFFICERS AND/OR DIRECTORS HAVE ENGAGED IN SECURITIES FRAUD OR OTHER UNLAWFUL BUSINESS PRACTICES.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-02 18:29:00', 'title': 'IBM LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - FEBRUARY 2, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF IBM INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE SOUTHERN DISTRICT OF NEW YORK.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-02-02 05:45:00', 'title': 'IBM LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION ("IBM" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: IBM) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF IBM INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN JANUARY 18, 2018 AND OCTOBER 16, 2018.'}{'symbol': 'ITW', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:00:00', 'title': 'ITW REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER AND FULL YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'FOURTH QUARTER 2022 HIGHLIGHTS'}{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2023-02-02 07:35:00', 'title': 'INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE ANNOUNCES 11% INCREASE TO ITS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA & NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE (NYSE: ICE), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF DATA, TECHNOLOGY, AND MARKET INFRASTRUCTURE, ANNOUNCED BOARD AUTHORIZATION OF ITS FIRST QUARTER 2023 DIVIDEND OF $0.42 PER SHARE, UP 11% FROM ITS PREVIOUS $0.38 PER SHARE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND IN 2022.'}{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2023-02-02 07:30:00', 'title': 'INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE REPORTS STRONG FULL YEAR 2022 RESULTS', 'text': 'ATLANTA & NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE (NYSE: ICE)'}{'symbol': 'IP', 'date': '2023-02-02 10:00:00', 'title': "INTERNATIONAL PAPER NAMED TO FORTUNE'S LIST OF WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR THE 20TH TIME", 'text': "MEMPHIS, TENN. , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- INTERNATIONAL PAPER (NYSE: IP) HAS BEEN NAMED TO\xa0FORTUNE MAGAZINE'S LIST OF WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANIES FOR THE 20TH TIME."}{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2023-02-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON TO PARTICIPATE IN THE COWEN 43RD ANNUAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE COWEN 43RD ANNUAL HEALTHCARE CONFERENCE ON TUESDAY, MARCH 7TH, AT THE BOSTON MARRIOTT COPLEY PLACE, BOSTON, MA. JOSEPH J. WOLK, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER WILL REPRESENT THE COMPANY IN A SESSION SCHEDULED AT 11:10 A.M. (EASTERN TIME).'}{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:47:00', 'title': 'KEYBANK LEVERAGES BLEND TO DELIVER DIGITAL MORTGAGE APPLICATION PROCESS FOR CLIENTS', 'text': 'CLOUD BANKING PLATFORM CLOSING LOANS MORE THAN TWO WEEKS FASTER CLEVELAND , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYBANK (NYSE: KEY) IS SEEING SIGNIFICANT RESULTS IN MAKING HOME BUYING EASIER FOR CLIENTS IN THE FACE OF A COMPETITIVE MARKET. A SOFTWARE PLATFORM THAT DIGITIZES THE END-TO-END MORTGAGE APPLICATION PROCESS FOR CLIENTS LOOKING TO PURCHASE OR REFINANCE A HOME, PROVIDED BY BLEND \xa0(NYSE: BLND),\xa0IS HELPING KEYBANK CLOSE HOME LOANS 17 DAYS FASTER, ON AVERAGE, THAN BEFORE THIS PLATFORM WAS INTEGRATED.'}{'symbol': 'KLAC', 'date': '2023-02-02 18:00:00', 'title': 'KLA DECLARES REGULAR CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'MILPITAS, CALIF. , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KLA CORPORATION\xa0(NASDAQ: KLAC) BOARD OF DIRECTORS TODAY DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND\xa0OF $1.30 PER SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON MARCH 1, 2023, TO KLA SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEB.13, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2023-02-02 09:30:00', 'title': "KROGER AWARDED RIPPLEMATCH'S 2023 CAMPUS FORWARD AWARD", 'text': 'GROCER RECOGNIZED NATIONALLY FOR VALUING GENERATION Z, EARLY-CAREER ASSOCIATES CINCINNATI , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR), AMERICA\'S GROCER, HAS BEEN AWARDED THE 2023 CAMPUS FORWARD AWARD IN THE ENTERPRISE EARLY CAREER PROGRAMS CATEGORY FOR EXCELLENCE IN EARLY CAREER HIRING. "WITH SIX GENERATIONS MAKING UP OUR WORKFORCE, KROGER UNDERSTANDS THE IMPORTANCE OF EARLY TALENT DEVELOPMENT AND HOW IMPACTFUL INTERNSHIP PROGRAMS CAN DEFINE OUR COMPANY CULTURE FOR YEARS TO COME," SAID TIM MASSA, SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF PEOPLE OFFICER AT KROGER.'}{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:01:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS TO PARTICIPATE IN THE COWEN 44TH ANNUAL AEROSPACE/DEFENSE & INDUSTRIALS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'LIVE AUDIO WEBCAST AVAILABLE ON FEB. 15, 2023, FROM 2:05 P.M. TO 2:45 P.M.'}{'symbol': 'LNC', 'date': '2023-02-02 09:00:00', 'title': 'PHOTO ADVISORY: TOUCHDOWN! LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP TALKS FINANCIAL WELLNESS GOALS WITH PHILADELPHIA EAGLES', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AFTER THE PHILADELPHIA EAGLES ACHIEVED A HUGE GOAL WINNING THE NFC CHAMPIONSHIP, LINCOLN FINANCIAL GROUP (NYSE: LNC) WENT INSIDE THE LOCKER ROOM TO TALK WITH A FEW OF THE PLAYERS ABOUT GOALS OF A DIFFERENT KIND: FINANCIAL WELLNESS. SINCE THE 2003 SEASON, LINCOLN FINANCIAL HAS PROUDLY BEEN THE SPONSOR OF LINCOLN FINANCIAL FIELD – HOME OF THE CONFERENCE CHAMPION EAGLES. FOR MORE INFORMATION ABOUT LINCOLN FINANCIAL AND ITS PARTNERSHIP WITH THE PHILADELPHIA EAGLES, PLEASE CLICK HERE.'}{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2023-02-02 16:05:00', 'title': 'LUMEN RESHAPING EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM TO DRIVE SIMPLIFICATION, CUSTOMER OBSESSION', 'text': 'CHANGES POSITION THE COMPANY FOR GROWTH AND SUCCESS DENVER , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TO SERVE CUSTOMERS BETTER AND BEST POSITION THE COMPANY FOR GROWTH, LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES\xa0(NYSE: LUMN) IS MAKING CHANGES TO ITS EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM OVER THE COMING WEEKS. SHAM CHOTAI HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, PRODUCT AND TECHNOLOGY, AND JAY BARROWS, EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, ENTERPRISE SALES AND PUBLIC SECTOR.'}{'symbol': 'LUMN', 'date': '2023-02-02 08:48:00', 'title': 'LUMEN WINS $223 MILLION DEFENSE INFORMATION SYSTEMS AGENCY CONTRACT', 'text': 'COMPANY WILL PROVIDE SECURE, MISSION-CRITICAL COMMUNICATIONS SERVICES WASHINGTON , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LUMEN TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: LUMN) RECENTLY WON A $223 MILLION CONTRACT FROM THE U.S. DEFENSE INFORMATION SYSTEMS AGENCY (DISA) TO PROVIDE SECURE, MISSION-CRITICAL COMMUNICATIONS SERVICES TO THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE. "THE U.S. DEPARTMENT OF DEFENSE HAS A FAR-REACHING MISSION TO PROVIDE MILITARY FORCES TO DE